OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA generally
OL,6,Fdry start to the night with variable
OL,7,Fcloud, although the odd shower is
OL,8,Fstill possible over Devon and
OL,9,FCornwall. Shower risk increases from
OL,10,Fthe west through the early hours,
OL,11,Fthese potentially heavy and thundery
OL,12,Fat times. Staying mild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FHeavy showers continue to move
OL,15,Feastward through the morning with
OL,16,Fisolated showers following in behind.
OL,17,FAnother rather warm day ahead.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
